-- title:
--   crouzeix palencia of smooth Jordan exhaustion support nested scalar Companion approximation: crouzeix palencia of smooth Jordan exhaustion support nested scalar Companion approximation
-- statement:
--   On a strictly nested smooth exhaustion, polynomial approximation of the
--   closed scalar companions is enough: integration on the next inner contour
--   automatically reproduces the polynomial auxiliary on the current contour.
--
--   Source: https://github.com/savarin/lean-operator-theory/blob/6f90bb7e6b056b54f56005e0416d77d6d7c2a478/Operator/Crouzeix/SmoothJordanExhaustion.lean#L649-L813
